{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51418","headline":"咏舜庙古杉 · 李合","name":"咏舜庙古杉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"总负亿年质，高临千仞峯。\n贞心欺晚桂，劲节掩寒松。\n任彼风飙折，挺然霜雪冲。\n茎凌霄汉表，根蟠龙窟中。\n仙客频栖舞，良工何渺逢。\n枝头连理翠，拥护圣神宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}